00:05:40.236 --> 00:06:06.075
That means when the consciousness is configured in a certain way, which is again one-sided, which is typical for consciousness, the opposite will be constellated in the unconscious, which means when somebody is extremely serious, extremely adult, and very much, let's say, adapted to their environment, they're very collective.

00:06:07.084 --> 00:06:22.797
They're just following the rules of society, rules of the family, rules of the relationship that they're in with their partner. There's something constellated in their unconscious that tries to bring them to the other side. And this side for Jung is the puer aeternus.

00:06:22.958 --> 00:06:37.437
